    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "so if the policy framework is the \"disease,\" then what's the cure? like, people suggest totally different things—some say we need more regulation and higher taxes, but others say we should actually be cutting red tape and letting the market work to create more jobs. which of those paths is actually the right one to take?",
